@startuml

' High Level IOU Creation, Denial of State Attack, and Consequence

!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title High Level: IOU Creation, DoS Attack, & Failed Legitimate Use

participant "Party A" as PA
participant "Party B" as PB
participant "Notary (Non-Validating)" as N

group #LightBlue Legitimate IOU Creation Phase 
    activate PA
    PA -> PB : 1. Propose IOU & Request Signature
    activate PB
    PB -> PB : Verify IOU Proposal
    PB -> PA : 2. Send IOU Signature
    deactivate PB
    PA -> PA : Assemble Signed IOU Tx
    PA -> N : 3. Request Notarization for Signed IOU Tx
    activate N
    N -> N : Check Inputs (OK), Record State Refs, Sign (Notarize)
    N --> PA : 4. Confirm IOU Notarized
    N --> PB : 5. Distribute Notarized IOU Tx Confirmation
    deactivate N
    PA -> PA : Record Final IOU State
    deactivate PA
    activate PB
    PB -> PB : Record Final IOU State
    deactivate PB
end group

note across
Time passes after IOU Creation
end note

group #pink  Denial of State Attack Phase (by Party A)
    activate PA
    PA -> PA : 1. Craft **Invalid** Tx Consuming IOU\n(e.g., missing PB signature, only PA signs)
    note right of PA : This Tx breaks contract rules,\nbut uses the valid IOU StateRef as input.

    PA -> N : 2. Request Notarization for **Invalid** Tx\n(Bypassing Party B entirely!)
    activate N
    N -> N : Check Input IOU StateRef (Not marked consumed yet)
    note right of N : Non-Validating: Skips contract/signature checks!
    N -> N : **Mark IOU StateRef as Consumed** (The DoS!)
    N -> N : Sign (Notarize) the **Invalid** Transaction
    N --> PA : 3. Confirm **Invalid** Tx Notarized
    deactivate N
    note right of PA : Attack successful! Notary thinks IOU is spent.\nPA does not share this invalid, notarized Tx with PB.
    PA -> PA : (Optionally Records Attack Tx)
    deactivate PA
end group

note across
Time passes after DoS Attack
end note

group #LightCoral  Consequence Phase (Party B's Attempted Use Fails)
    activate PB
    PB -> PB : 1. Decide to spend/settle the IOU
    ' Assuming contract requires both signatures for valid spend
    PB -> PA : 2. Propose Spending IOU & Request Signature
    activate PA
    PA -> PA : (Signs the valid proposal)
    PA -> PB : 3. Send Signature for Valid Spend Tx
    deactivate PA
    PB -> PB : 4. Assemble **Valid**, Fully Signed Tx
    note left of PB : This transaction is contractually valid.

    PB -> N : 5. Request Notarization for **Valid** Spend Tx
    activate N
    N -> N : Check Input IOU StateRef
    note right of N : Notary finds IOU StateRef was **already marked consumed**\nduring the previous DoS attack phase!
    N -> N : Generate Conflict / Double Spend Error
    N --> PB : 6. **Reject Tx: Conflict/Double Spend Error**
    deactivate N
    PB -> PB : Flow Fails! Cannot use IOU State.
    note left of PB : Denial of State successful.\nLegitimate use is blocked by the Notary.
    deactivate PB

end group


@enduml